{"type":"text","timestamp":1794545887141,"sessionID":"ses_e2cbdea85ffe6Kx4AUdo389t1W","part":{"id":"prt_1d3452505002tH5NnBERcqhNB5","sessionID":"ses_e2cbdea85ffe6Kx4AUdo389t1W","messageID":"msg_1d345071a001bAUubfX0w7wMoU","type":"text","text":"T008 is implemented and verified.\n\n## Files written\n\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs`\n  - Moved the `offered` count out of the start-row block in `addScored`, counting every scored row whose offer named the row's expected command.\n  - Added `cappedOfferRows` (counted when the offered row is capped) and kept `startedOfOffered` for the non-capped offered rows that started.\n  - Added `cappedOfferRows: 0` to `newTally` and `cappedOfferRows` after `offered` in `tallyBlock`.\n  - `writeSummary` now prints `offered N (M capped), started X of N-M`.\n  - Left the `offerUnknown` count inside the start-row block, unchanged in behavior.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts`\n  - Added one summary case: `SUMMARY_ROW` at `exit: 143` with `offeredCommand: '/create:agent'` plus `cmd-create-agent-plain-tune-02` at `exit: 0` with the same offer asserts `offered: 2, cappedOfferRows: 1, startedOfOffered: 1`.\n\n## Verify output\n\n`VT` in `ADV` (`env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD npx vitest run tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts`):\n\n```\n RUN  v4.1.12 /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  50 passed (50)\n```\n\nSummary query over `$POST`:\n\n```\n{\"claude\":[3,0,1],\"codex\":[3,0,0],\"devin\":[3,0,1],\"dsh\":[3,0,2],\"opencode\":[3,2,0],\"pi\":[3,1,1]}\n```\n\nBoth match the task's expected output exactly. The diff is limited to the two named files, no checkbox was ticked, and no git state was touched. Nothing was left undone.\n\nOne note for whoever runs T015: the surviving `offerUnknown` check in `addScored` is now an `if` inside the start-row block, not an `else if` attached to the moved offer count, since the offer branch no longer lives there.","time":{"start":1794545886469,"end":1794545887141}}}
